      "big_idea": "New forecast = α x this year's actual + (1 - α) x this year's forecast.",
      "analogy": null,
      "visuals": [],
      "worked": null,
      "watch_out": [
        "α goes with the **actual** Y(t); (1 - α) goes with the old **forecast** F(t)."
